  "known_gaps": [
    "Exploratory configured-64 samples observed both pinned releases reaching 64 concurrent upstream requests while Modex stayed capped at 12; the measurements are non-reproducible from committed code and remain a visible, unqualified mismatch.",
    "Effective worker execution remains bounded by Mojo parallelism. The four-worker default floor can exceed scheduler parallelism on hosts with fewer than four schedulable lanes; the automated test qualifies active concurrency as min(configured workers, parallelism) and does not claim 12-lane parity there.",
    "This is a focused Linux x86_64 qualification only. The six-target denominator, other platforms, and unverified security behaviors remain open."
  ],
